      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Cayó al mar. Dos diosas marinas lo vieron: Tetis y Eurínome.",
          "en": "He crashed into the sea. Two sea goddesses saw him fall: Thetis and Eurynome."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tetis era una ninfa, uno de esos espíritus amables que viven en el agua.",
          "en": "Thetis was a nymph, one of those kind spirits who live in the water."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo sacaron de las olas y se lo llevaron a una cueva bajo el mar.",
          "en": "They pulled him out of the waves and carried him to a cave under the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hera creyó que su hijo había muerto. En el Olimpo, nadie supo que seguía vivo.",
          "en": "Hera thought her son was dead. On Olympus, nobody knew he was still alive."
        }
