      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Un día, Hefesto hizo un regalo para Hera: un hermoso trono de oro.",
          "en": "One day, Hephaestus made a gift for Hera: a beautiful golden throne."
        },
        {
          "es": "Lo envió al Olimpo, y los dioses quedaron maravillados. Nunca habían visto algo tan bello.",
          "en": "He sent it to Olympus, and the gods gasped. They had never seen anything so lovely."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hera se sentó en él, orgullosa y feliz.",
          "en": "Hera sat on it, proud and happy."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero el trono era una trampa. Unas cadenas ocultas, demasiado finas para verse, la sujetaron.",
          "en": "But the throne was a trap. Hidden chains, too fine to see, wrapped around her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hera quiso levantarse y no pudo. Todos los dioses intentaron liberarla, y todos fallaron.",
          "en": "Hera tried to stand, and she could not. Every god tried to free her, and every god failed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hera estaba atrapada en su propio regalo. ¿Tú la habrías perdonado?",
          "en": "Hera was stuck in her own gift. Would you have forgiven her?"
        }
      ],
