      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses le rogaron a Hefesto que volviera para liberarla.",
          "en": "The gods begged Hephaestus to come back and set her free."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Hefesto se negó.",
          "en": "But Hephaestus refused."
        },
        {
          "es": "En un relato antiguo, solo responde esto: «Yo no tengo madre».",
          "en": "In one old tale, he answers only this: \"I have no mother.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Otro relato cuenta que Ares, el dios de la guerra, quiso asustarlo con fuego. Hefesto lo echó con sus propias antorchas.",
          "en": "Another tale says Ares, the god of war, tried to scare him with fire. Hephaestus chased him away with his own torches."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así que los dioses probaron de otra manera.",
          "en": "So the gods tried a different way."
        }
