      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En su fragua, Hefesto construyó maravillas para los dioses.",
          "en": "In his forge, Hephaestus built wonders for the gods."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hizo sus palacios de bronce y forjó los rayos que lanza Zeus.",
          "en": "He built their palaces of bronze, and he forged the lightning bolts that Zeus throws."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hizo doncellas de oro que caminaban y lo ayudaban a trabajar.",
          "en": "He made golden maidens who could walk and help him work."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y más tarde forjó una armadura brillante para un héroe llamado Aquiles.",
          "en": "And later he forged a shining suit of armor for a hero named Achilles."
        },
        {
          "es": "El dios que nadie quería se volvió el dios que todos necesitaban.",
          "en": "The god nobody wanted became the god everybody needed."
        }
